{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026Q8Bd5Nwldi1793719095.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美國中期選舉投票展開，美股個別發展，道指早段曾跌約390點。</p><p></p><p>道指略為低開後，跌幅曾經擴大至390點，跌穿51,600點。納指則曾升逾200點，迫近25,400點水平。</p><p></p><p>科技股普遍向好，戴爾電腦和英特爾早段升百分之3至4。晶片商美光科技和閃迪，亦升百分之3至4。蘋果公司上季毛利率收窄，股價急挫百分之4，見約一個月低位。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T16:21:15.216083+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":160,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T15:12:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T04:38:24.411653+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T16:18:26.818105+00:00","content_hash":"3ee122264e0862289b7369f35df0611e90fbc4f2e6f2a10a05465469666a20c1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-03T16:21:15.216083+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}